        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0640" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg532"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 13.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit to you
                    herewith the application of William Lassonne for a new passport and to request
                    instructions thereon.</p>
                <p>Mr. Lassonne informs me verbally that it is his desire to go to the United States
                    this summer, but whether on a visit or to settle there permanently, he is unable
                    to make positive statement.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Andrew D. White</hi>.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d515-a1.xml" xpointer="d515-a1"/>
